  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Runs a seeded Monte Carlo volumetric CO2 storage-capacity simulation over a batch of site scenarios (inputs given as triangular low/mode/high estimates), then shows Q10/Q50/Q90 capacity per site, a rank-correlation sensitivity breakdown, and a demonstration-only containment-attention score with its components. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
